./contributingGuides/NAVIGATION.md:90:- To make sure that we have the correct navigation state after changing the layout, we need to force react to create new instance of the `NavigationContainer`. Without this, the navigation state could be broken after changing the type of layout.
./contributingGuides/NAVIGATION.md:94:- To keep the navigation state that was present before changing the layout, we save the state on every change and use it for the `initialState` prop.
